<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data rated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Electronic Data Systems Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 33.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Jim Marks said set earnings per share estimates at $2.13 for 1997 and $2.50 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Said expects next three-to-four quarters to be &quot;somewhat turbulent&quot; at EDS.</p>
</text>
